Below is a **drop-in replacement `frontend/src/App.jsx`** that gives you a modern, responsive Tailwind dashboard UI **without breaking your concurrency/race-condition testing**.

It includes:
- Dashboard summary cards (**Total Stock**, **Out of Stock Items**, **Recent Alerts**)
